logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
scratch/
*/scratch/
temp/
tmp/
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.tmp

